\chapter{Problems Related to Volume VI}
\label{ch:companion-vi}

\paragraph{Main-text correspondence.}
This Part accompanies \emph{Volume VI: Algebraic Geometry and Sheaf Theory}, whose canonical chapter range is
\texttt{VI/01--VI/49}. Imported problems will be grouped here by mathematical theme rather
than by reproducing the main volume chapter tree.

The principal main-text regions are:
\begin{itemize}
  \item \textbf{Classical Affine Geometry}: Chapters VI/01--VI/05.
  \item \textbf{Prime Spectra}: Chapters VI/06--VI/11.
  \item \textbf{Sheaves}: Chapters VI/12--VI/17.
  \item \textbf{Affine and General Schemes}: Chapters VI/18--VI/22.
  \item \textbf{Morphisms and Families}: Chapters VI/23--VI/28.
  \item \textbf{Dimension}: Chapters VI/29--VI/32.
  \item \textbf{Modules and Projective Geometry}: Chapters VI/33--VI/38.
  \item \textbf{Divisors and Birational Geometry}: Chapters VI/39--VI/45.
  \item \textbf{Sheaf Cohomology}: Chapters VI/46--VI/49.
\end{itemize}

\paragraph{Migration status.}
This scaffold intentionally contains no imported problem statements yet. The next pass
will populate the Companion atlas, assign stable Companion IDs, and create thematic
sections from the reconciled semantic problem units.
